through ten planets on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T22:01:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219669","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5060940-1843481262692993","game_id":"steam-5060940","kind":"announcement","title":"Space suits, distinct corgis, and a livelier demo","summary":"Scout has some very good company The Windows demo has been updated with suited corgis, personality backpacks, and more little moments around camp. Your first three rescues each bring something different to the journey: Mechanic, in yellow: tends the rocket with a little backpack welder. Watch for the sparks and a small \"Bzzzz.\" Security, in blue: chases visiting wildlife with an oversized megaphone and an equally oversized bork. Mining, in amber: heads out to gather with a backpack laser. The li","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T17:22:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692993","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5060940-1843481262687636","game_id":"steam-5060940","kind":"announcement","title":"Corgis with freaking laser beams!","summary":"The corgis have laser backpacks now. The recoil comes with a backflip lol. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y8X0WxxItIU Demo 1.3.0 is live! The fifth automatic gathering upgrade gives your corgi a laser backpack. It opens up, charges, blasts the resource, and sends the corgi into a backflip before packing itself away. The backpack bounces around while the corgi runs, then steadies to aim. This update also brings a stranded corgi to rescue on each of the three planets. Scout pets them, they join t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-0